## 2. File System Summary

```
refii/
├── .AGENTS                     # This instructions and project guidelines file
├── refii_recomp.*.cpp          # Recompiled PPC game logic source files
├── sources.cmake, rexglue.cmake# CMake configuration for native recomp build
├── src/                        # Native C++ host layer
│   ├── hostbridge/             # Bridge interfacing native guest calls with host
│   ├── vfs/                    # Native virtual filesystem hooks
│   ├── hooks/                  # Function detour hooks and guest patches
│   ├── host_audio.*            # Host audio streaming
│   ├── host_input.*            # Gamepad and keyboard input handling
│   ├── upscaler/ & shader/     # Rendering pipelines and post-processing
│   └── lua/                    # Native Lua script integration
├── Godot/                      # Godot 4 .NET host project (C#)
│   ├── refii-launcher.sln      # Solution file for host engine and tests
│   ├── refii-launcher.csproj   # Host engine project (build triggers automated tests)
│   ├── src/                    # Host engine C# source code
│   │   ├── Engine/             # Core host subsystems
│   │   │   ├── bnk/            # BnkFileSystem, archive reading, virtual mounting
│   │   │   ├── gdb/            # Game Database (GDB) parsing, patching, composting
│   │   │   ├── mods/           # F2ModPackage (.f2mod), load order, manifests, overlays
│   │   │   ├── text/           # Babel text databases and CSV row overlays
│   │   │   ├── tex/            # Xbox 360 texture swizzling & PNG conversion
│   │   │   ├── mdl/            # 3D model parsing & GLTF mesh conversion
│   │   │   ├── equipment/      # Weapon, clothing, item indexes
│   │   │   └── entities/       # Entity definitions and indexes
│   │   ├── launcher/           # Launcher UI, settings, and modding management panel
│   │   └── game/               # In-game HUD, UI, and host presentation nodes
│   ├── addons/
│   │   └── bnk_mount/          # In-editor live asset browser, inspector & mod creator
│   ├── assets/
│   │   └── mods/               # Target folder for .f2mod mod packages (no loose folders)
│   ├── docs/                   # Architecture and unit testing guides
│   └── tests/
│       └── Refii.Tests/        # Automated GdUnit4Net test project
├── notes/                      # User's research documentation, format specs, modding design
└── tools/                      # Python/shell tools (disassemblers, debuggers, contracts)
```

